 iPad Pros, Mac computers, and more. Business Insider was in attendance to see it all happen live.\nHere's everything Apple announced at its big October event.\n8:54 a.m.: The event took place at the Brooklyn Academy of Music. Apple dressed it all up for the big occasion.\n9:09 a.m.: Plenty of Apple executives were in attendance, including Craig Federighi, aka \"Hair Force One,\" who oversees the development of Apple's iPhone and Mac software.\n9:25 a.m.: Thankfully, there was plenty of food to enjoy during the wait.\nSee the rest of the story at Business Insider", "external_links": ["http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=wVgYCQ1TQ4o:_YDtnnrMZwA:yIl2AUoC8zA", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=wVgYCQ1TQ4o:_YDtnnrMZwA:cGdyc7Q-1BI", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=wVgYCQ1TQ4o:_YDtnnrMZwA:qj6IDK7rITs", "https://static3.businessinsider.com/image/5b8657ac0ce5f591208b4abf-2400/tim", "https://www.businessinsider.com/apple-october-event-live-blog-all-announcements-2018-10#/#10-am-apple-kicked-off-the-event-with-a-video-of-people-using-apple-devices-around-new-york-citys-most-iconic-locations-then-ceo-tim-cook-took-the-stage-4", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?d=cGdyc7Q-1BI", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?d=bcOpcFrp8Mo", "http://feedproxy.google.com/~r/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider/~3/wVgYCQ1TQ4o/apple-october-event-live-blog-all-announcements-2018-10", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=wVgYCQ1TQ4o:_YDtnnrMZwA:7Q72WNTAKBA", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?i=wVgYCQ1TQ4o:_YDtnnrMZwA:V_sGLiPBpWU", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~r/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider/~4/wVgYCQ1TQ4o", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?d=